## Edge Cases to Remember

- All color values use HSL without `hsl()` wrapper for alpha channel support
- CSS variables use semantic names (--primary, not --blue-500)
- Radix UI components need `asChild` prop for composition
- React.forwardRef required for ref forwarding
- displayName should be set on all forwardRef components
- Tailwind content paths must include `@core-erp/ui/dist/**/*.js`
- Build output is ESM only (no CommonJS)
- Peer dependencies are external (not bundled)
- Components must work without @core-erp/ui styles (consumers import)

